{"actor": "opencode", "data": {"summary": "Falsification run 1: the obvious functional probe (git ls-remote) is vacuous here because the remote is public; 'git credential fill' is rejected by this App arrangement. Discovered the live defect: ~/.config/github-app/git-credential-helper.sh on this VM still invokes /tmp/github-app-jwt.sh, the exact /tmp dependency STATE.md records as having broken pushes on instance-20260717-0947, and doctor prints 'credentials none present' while the mechanism is one /tmp clear away from failing."}, "host": "instance-20260717-0944", "kind": "milestone", "schema": "origin.session.event/1", "seq": 3, "session": "2026-10-03-040-make-origin-doctor-read-the-push-credent", "ts": "2026-10-03T23:47:28+00:00"}
