{"actor": "opencode", "data": {"refs": ["DECISIONS-GATING.md", "tools/originlib/pushprobe.py"], "summary": "Make doctor distinguish 'no credential mechanism' from 'a mechanism that stopped working' rather than reporting both as broken. Observed: the first implementation's verdict order called a fresh VM with no credential 'broken', which is the incident that cost this fleet a push and would have sent the next agent hunting a helper that was never configured. A diagnostic that cannot tell 'never set up' from 'stopped working' still does not read the property it reports."}, "host": "instance-20260717-0944", "kind": "decision", "schema": "origin.session.event/1", "seq": 19, "session": "2026-10-03-040-make-origin-doctor-read-the-push-credent", "ts": "2026-10-04T00:05:18+00:00"}
